sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Test Runner
    participant C as Snapshot Cache
    participant F as FAST Engine

    R->>C: Collect test IDs
    alt Snapshot exists
        C->>C: Compute Git tree diff
    else First run
        C->>C: Create initial snapshot
        C->>C: Compute Git tree diff
    end
    C-->>F: Partition into new / unchanged / deleted
    F->>F: Prioritize new, then unchanged
    F-->>R: Combined order (new first, deleted removed)
